abstract: >-
  Ten thousand symmetric and balanced IM7/8552 laminate designs with
  deterministic Classical Lamination Theory labels, public NCAMP experimental
  material-property summary statistics, group-safe splits, and a frozen
  protocol for paired physical validation.
